* UIR 3, variant 41/3, M3, open
* Stream 1 routes; streams 2-5 serve U1-U4; 6 arrives; 7 selects a phase.
                RMULT 64010,128017,192024,256031,320038,384045,448052
* P2 is the node-arrival clock. P3 accumulates waiting over the cycle.
StoreU1        STORAGE 3
Delay1          QTABLE QueueU1,0,1,16
Visit1          TABLE MP2,0,5,12
StoreU2        STORAGE 2
Delay2          QTABLE QueueU2,0,1,16
Visit2          TABLE MP2,0,5,12
StoreU3        STORAGE 1
Delay3          QTABLE QueueU3,0,1,16
Visit3          TABLE MP2,0,5,12
StoreU4        STORAGE 1
Delay4          QTABLE QueueU4,0,1,16
Visit4          TABLE MP2,0,5,12
Residence       TABLE M1,0,25,18
WaitNet         TABLE P3,0,25,18

* Create the fixed population or generate external arrivals.
                GENERATE (Exponential(6,0,15.5555555556))
Cycle           MARK
                ASSIGN 3,0
* Node 1: FCFS queue and 3 parallel server(s).
NodeU1         MARK 2
                QUEUE QueueU1
                ENTER StoreU1
                DEPART QueueU1
                ASSIGN 3+,MP2
                ADVANCE (Exponential(2,0,4))
                LEAVE StoreU1
                TABULATE Visit1
* One draw routes with equal probabilities to 0, 2, 3, 4.
                ASSIGN 1,RN1
                TEST GE P1,250,NetExit
                TEST GE P1,500,NodeU2
                TEST GE P1,750,NodeU3
                TRANSFER ,NodeU4
* Node 2: FCFS queue and 2 parallel server(s).
NodeU2         MARK 2
                QUEUE QueueU2
                ENTER StoreU2
                DEPART QueueU2
                ASSIGN 3+,MP2
                ADVANCE (Exponential(3,0,2.5))
                LEAVE StoreU2
                TABULATE Visit2
                TRANSFER ,NodeU1
* Node 3: FCFS queue and 1 parallel server(s).
NodeU3         MARK 2
                QUEUE QueueU3
                ENTER StoreU3
                DEPART QueueU3
                ASSIGN 3+,MP2
                ADVANCE (Exponential(4,0,14))
                LEAVE StoreU3
                TABULATE Visit3
                TRANSFER ,NodeU1
* Node 4: FCFS queue and 1 parallel server(s).
NodeU4         MARK 2
                QUEUE QueueU4
                ENTER StoreU4
                DEPART QueueU4
                ASSIGN 3+,MP2
                ADVANCE (Exponential(5,0,5))
                LEAVE StoreU4
                TABULATE Visit4
                TRANSFER ,NodeU1
NetExit         TABULATE Residence
                TABULATE WaitNet
                TERMINATE

* Stop once for warm-up and once at the end of measurement.
                GENERATE 100000,,,1
                TERMINATE 1
                GENERATE 1100000,,,1
                TERMINATE 1
                START 1,NP
                RESET
                START 1
